    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 HireFlow — Resume Intake & AI Screening\nA résumé hits the careers form → it's parsed, scored against a data-driven Airtable scorecard, deduped into an ATS pipeline, and the hiring manager gets a Slack review card.\n**AI recommends — a human decides.**\n**n8n · OpenAI · Airtable · Gmail · Slack**",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        10,
        -300
      ],
      "id": "ba1d6167-21f1-4692-91d3-580466bf36b8",
      "name": "Sticky 010421fd"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1 · Résumé in\nApplicant submits the careers form with a PDF. Extract From File pulls clean text from the résumé (handles column/table layouts).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        10,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "bf81625d-9678-4a81-a265-fa107a0cfa79",
      "name": "Sticky 08fff2f9"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2 · Load the scorecard\nAirtable pulls THIS role's must-haves / nice-to-haves / weights and injects them into the prompt. Change the rubric in Airtable, not the workflow — that's the multi-role story.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        430,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "ded5cb62-6850-4fa1-9524-3fbf7ecf002b",
      "name": "Sticky 44826fd8"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 · AI screening\ngpt-4o-mini scores the candidate against the scorecard, judging ONLY job-relevant evidence (ignores name/age/school dates). Normalize parses structured JSON: score, recommendation, hits/misses, red flags, reasoning = the audit log.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        846,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "1257d9e3-2e7c-4d7e-afc4-9452b537121d",
      "name": "Sticky ac60b929"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4 · Dedupe & persist\nSearch + If dedupe on email+role so re-submissions don't double-file. New candidates continue; Create a record writes the scored candidate to the Airtable ATS at Stage = Screened.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1270,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "70f92ed0-cc41-40a0-8de8-4dfbab4482e7",
      "name": "Sticky 12e7e8fc"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5 · Notify\nNeutral acknowledgment auto-sent to the applicant — the ONLY auto-send in the whole build, and it's score-blind. Then a Slack review card posts to the hiring channel with Approve / Decline buttons.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "5da8d7ea-65c3-478a-9de4-9ebb528a4330",
      "name": "Sticky 11fe1d1f"
    }
  ],
